r's_Chamber\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Inquisitor's Chamber</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;1345&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-669</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The slate is densely packed with carvings. A few words recur throughout: 'Voss', '<a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_vocabulary#hshar'lak\" title=\"Githyanki vocabulary\">hshar'lak</a>', 'Vlaakith', 'loyalty'. A note has been written over the text in Common.]\n</p><p><br>\nVoss - traitor?\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The content implies this was intended to be a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Slate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Githyanki Slate\">Githyanki Slate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222300\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2017/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28524/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7772/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 943760/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.523      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   51.523      1 -total\n 61.54%   31.709      9 Template:Icon_text\n 53.94%   27.791     21 Template:Trim\n 40.81%   21.029      1 Template:PageSeo\n 40.74%   20.988      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.15%   16.051      4 Template:Icon_link\n 23.10%   11.901      1 Template:CharLink\n 21.75%   11.205      9 Template:Ifempty\n 19.00%    9.788      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12576-0!canonic